i, [name], I understand you're team leader/manager)\\n    Second, expalin reason about the task or step\\n    Third, clearly provide the requirement for the people\\n- Please send the message to people if the task required\\n- If you send the message including the numbers (e.g. money, budget, count etc.), please send the plain numbers without formating (e.g. comma) \\n- If you just the conclusion to the person, please make message concrete and clear without extra words.\\n \\n\\nRULES:\\n- Do NOT deviate from this step.\\n- Use available tools to make PROGRESS.\\n- When you have FULLY and SUCCESSFULLY completed this step, output ONLY the following line and nothing else:\\n  <|STEP_COMPLETED|>\\n\\n\", image_urls=None, wait_for_response=False, action=<ActionType.MESSAGE: 'message'>, security_risk=None), AgentFinishAction(final_thought='Verified! tasks is finished', task_completed=None, outputs={}, thought='', action=<ActionType.FINISH: 'finish'>)], inputs={}, outputs={}, agent_state=<AgentState.FINISHED: 'finished'>, resume_state=None, traffic_control_state=<TrafficControlState.NORMAL: 'normal'>, metrics=Metrics({'accumulated_cost': 0.10620091, 'accumulated_token_usage': {'model': 'default', 'prompt_tokens': 1308763, 'completion_tokens': 3831, 'cache_read_tokens': 1256896, 'cache_write_tokens': 0, 'context_window': 65536, 'per_turn_token': 58525, 'response_id': ''}, 'costs': [{'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0005107, 'timestamp': 1762576075.739362}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00049456, 'timestamp': 1762576078.8806894}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00016094000000000001, 'timestamp': 1762576083.1498866}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00068868, 'timestamp': 1762576086.5799887}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0011409200000000001, 'timestamp': 1762576096.2206533}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00142543, 'timestamp': 1762576104.1662376}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost